  day: 3
  text: "Big boss. As per our deal I\u2019ll tell you something you\u2019d really
    wanna know. Robert is a murderer. That\u2019s right. That timid little man has
    got secrets, he doesn\u2019t want to be in B1 because of the dark. That\u2019s
    at least what he tells you. In reality he\u2019s afraid of what he did in the
    dark. I think you should remind him. A murderer does not deserve kindness, don't
    you think?"
